feat: migrate vulnerability data from JSON files to SQLite database

Replace scattered JSON intermediate files with a single SQLite database
(scan.db) for vulnerability lifecycle data storage.

New tools:
- vuln-db: SQLite CRUD tool with init/insert/query/update/batch-update/
  dedup/stats/log/export-json commands
- report-generator: programmatic Markdown report generation from SQLite,
  ensuring 100% vulnerability coverage (fixes report truncation)

New skill:
- vulnerability-db: documents DB schema, vuln-db API, agent patterns

Agent updates:
- orchestrator: adds DB init step, passes DB_PATH to all sub-agents
- scanners: use vuln-db insert instead of JSON file writes
- verification: uses vuln-db dedup/query/batch-update
- reporter: uses report-generator for complete skeleton

Deprecated: merge-json tool no longer used for vulnerability data
